<title>USA: Lazare Kaplan Q2 Nov 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Lazare Kaplan Q2 Nov 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>LAZARE KAPLAN INTERNATIONAL INC.</p>
<p>(Unaudited, $ in thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>			 Three Months Ended    Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			    November 30,	   November 30,</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales		80,271     72,294    149,671    133,991</p>
<p> Net income		2,904	1,529	4,562	2,314</p>
